      "content": "i get the political symbolism part, but the patterns are way too regular for just 'monumental axes'. if u look at the way the residential sectors are spaced out compared to the central axis, it looks like specifically tuned components. like, if those roads were actually conducting certain frequencies, what kind of wave pattern would that layout create? i feel like there has to be a mathematical way to figure out the resonance of a layout like that.",
